## 1. Host Dependencies & Directory Setup

Execute these steps on the MLM Server (SLES 15 SP7) to enable required modules, install dependencies, and initialize the web-accessible repository path.

```bash
# 1. Enable the Development Tools module and install tools
SUSEConnect -p sle-module-development-tools/15.7/x86_64
zypper refresh && zypper --non-interactive install inotify-tools createrepo_c

# 2. Create web-accessible storage and set permissions
REPO_DIR="/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/srv-www/_data/htdocs/pub/ptf_repo/mls7"
mkdir -p "${REPO_DIR}"
chmod 755 "${REPO_DIR}"

# 3. Initialize repository metadata structure
createrepo_c "${REPO_DIR}"

```

