### B. Inotify Debounce Watcher

Create `/usr/local/bin/watch_ptf_repo.sh` to prevent partial synchronization during multi-file transfers:

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

REPO_DIR="/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/srv-www/_data/htdocs/pub/ptf_repo/mls7"
SYNC_SCRIPT="/usr/local/bin/sync-ptf-repo.sh"
TIMEOUT_SECS=120

echo "Watching ${REPO_DIR} for RPM changes..."

while true; do
  inotifywait -q -e close_write,moved_to "${REPO_DIR}" >/dev/null 2>&1
  echo "Activity detected. Debouncing for ${TIMEOUT_SECS} seconds..."
  
  while true; do
    if inotifywait -q -t "${TIMEOUT_SECS}" -e close_write,moved_to "${REPO_DIR}" >/dev/null 2>&1; then
      echo "Additional file incoming. Resetting timer..."
    else
      break
    fi
  done
  
  echo "Quiet window reached. Executing repository sync..."
  "${SYNC_SCRIPT}"
done

```

Set script permissions:

```bash
chmod 750 /usr/local/bin/watch_ptf_repo.sh

```

