### C. Systemd Unit Setup

Configure the watcher daemon via `/etc/systemd/system/ptf-watcher.service`:

```ini
[Unit]
Description=PTF RPM Inotify Debounce Watcher and MLM Sync
After=network.target local-fs.target
Wants=local-fs.target

[Service]
Type=simple
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/watch_ptf_repo.sh
Restart=always
RestartSec=10
KillMode=control-group
StandardOutput=journal
StandardError=journal

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target

```

Reload systemd and activate the service:

```bash
systemctl daemon-reload
systemctl enable --now ptf-watcher.service
systemctl status ptf-watcher.service --no-pager

```

